<https://hexplain.io/ns/geo#axisElevation> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "Use for georeferenced datasets. Combine the dataset kind with the appropriate raster, geometry, point-cloud, spatial-reference and provenance aspects. Use this IRI as a controlled value where the profile or a shape accepts its declared type."@en .
