<https://hexplain.io/ns/geo#axisLatitude> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "Use for georeferenced datasets. Combine the dataset kind with the appropriate raster, geometry, point-cloud, spatial-reference and provenance aspects. Use this IRI as a controlled value where the profile or a shape accepts its declared type."@en .
<https://hexplain.io/ns/geo#axisLongitude> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Deprecated duplicate of dlv:axisX, kept so existing descriptions resolve. Geographic meaning of a grid axis comes from its spatial reference, not from a separate axis individual."@en .
